    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MMWard Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 18 Millbank Square to the market.\n\nThis bright and well presented two bedroom, first floor apartment is ideally situated in the heart of Sallins Village, offering modern and comfortable living within walking distance of an excellent range of local amenities.\n\nThe accommodation is well laid out and features an upgraded kitchen, a spacious living/dining area and a private balcony overlooking a landscaped green, providing a bright and welcoming space to relax. \n\nThe property also benefits from two generously proportioned bedrooms and a well-appointed bathroom.\n\nAdditional features include gas fired central heating, double glazed windows, secure coded front door access, lift access and designated parking.\n\n Millbank Square is a highly sought after development with Lidl conveniently located within the complex. \n\nSallins Train Station is just a short stroll away, providing an excellent commuter service to Dublin, while the nearby Grand Canal offers kilometres of scenic walking and cycling routes. \n\nThe M7 motorway is also within easy reach, making this an ideal location for commuters.\n\nCombining a superb village centre location with excellent transport links and well-presented accommodation, this property will appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\nHot press and enclosed storage cupboard\n\nOpen plan living/kitchen - 20'1\" (6.12m) x 14'1\" (4.29m)\nFully fitted kitchen complete with oven, hob and extractor fan, Featuring a combination of tiled and wooden flooring, Balcony\n\nBedroom 1 - 14'0\" (4.27m) x 10'2\" (3.1m)\nSpacious bedroom with built-in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 2 - 13'7\" (4.14m) x 8'4\" (2.54m)\nSpacious bedroom with built-in wardrobes\n\nBathroom - 5'6\" (1.68m) x 6'5\" (1.96m)\nTiled floor, Part wall tiling, Bath with shower mixer and glass screen, WC and Wash hand basin.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> 2 bed first floor apartment </li><li> GFCH </li><li> Double Glazed windows </li><li> Parking </li><li> Coded front door </li><li> Lift access </li><li> Centre of Sallins Village </li><li> Walking distance to train station</li></ul>"
